===Notes===
*This talent cannot be learned by the player. It is the passive talent carried by the drone created by the {{t|Arcane Amplification Drone}} prodigy, and is what produces the ripple.
*Only spell damage dealt by the drone's summoner is amplified. All other damage dealt to the drone is simply negated.
*See {{t|Arcane Amplification Drone}} for the full details of how the ripple works.

